#: ninefruits/institution/admin_support.py
msgid ""
"Rows are matched by code: importing the same file again updates instead of "
"duplicating. Empty translation cells keep existing translations."
msgstr ""
"ແຖວຖືກຈັບຄູ່ດ້ວຍລະຫັດ: ການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນຄືນຈະອັບເດດ ແທນທີ່ຈະຊ້ຳ. "
"ຊ່ອງແປທີ່ວ່າງຈະຮັກສາຄຳແປເດີມ."

#: ninefruits/institution/admin_support.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Import #%(id)s queued (%(rows)s rows). This page shows the result when it is "
"finished."
msgstr ""
"ໄດ້ຮັບການນຳເຂົ້າ #%(id)s (%(rows)s ແຖວ) ແລ້ວ. ເມື່ອສຳເລັດ ໜ້ານີ້ຈະສະແດງຜົນ."

